    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p class="" data-start="118" data-end="563">Sesame oil is celebrated for its distinctive aroma, rich nutritional profile, and versatile uses. Yet, one common question remains: <strong data-start="250" data-end="277">Does sesame oil expire?</strong> In this blog, we dive deep into the factors that influence sesame oil’s shelf life, compare different sesame varieties, explore how and why sesame oil spoils, discuss potential health risks, and provide detailed storage guidelines—all backed by scientific data and real-world examples.</p><hr class="" data-start="565" data-end="568" /><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">Table of Contents</p>
